176302987875966_9164725694824432033_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=QPj6UYPvZN4Q7kNvwGHJR1q&_nc_oc=AdmszrS5oqQCUymgk0iTv4myukHX2V8-yk63Cgv7Ar8-RtuILO6JDKgosc6uCK3o6RE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfyyO4g-dWzVUV1ik5Wd5SG9wBabV7FNNdATzhQnDxXygg&oe=69B2C28C"}, {"file_name": "3.png", "id": "4121623981451906", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825052_4121623984785239_240546526297102524_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=lcHgCD55gpMQ7kNvwGqA0Pc&_nc_oc=Adk_7rjgJjKnXa8iuzvNANxM42lbSdLAYGGzeXaVEZjZf-UDFcZP3HjpUF2W-YzOriY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfwSdKx3Slc-izJZNtH-pUJsFL6imkfOqVgJn0qzSyYbtg&oe=69B2997F"}, {"file_name": "4.png", "id": "1657230814964766", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491831276_1657230818298099_6790316724559446786_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=WkHndtCQyCYQ7kNvwHEmyLr&_nc_oc=AdlYFDD7WGF2NRHzFtSAu5wPNxhquBcAoPrIUU-g7kJogbA9DGSCHHGC6K_Z7AArdLU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfwXRz2Jv0dwum_7wtoKmoLsakV94b7rw4_uqWYc7-8R1w&oe=69B2BFEC"}, {"file_name": "5.png", "id": "1396965764708962", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825050_1396965768042295_60285664847001603_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=onIrp7FfUBwQ7kNvwFGomZv&_nc_oc=AdlLZ75MM4_jMyy-U_U0dtEKDqMBeXyYYJo6OV7yu7qCz7TzhvgoxzZhMbWZjgJ3NpY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfytlwC2E78Sm3q-Z-y3G35Ey311E0RIY6zGATB1aAL_MA&oe=69B2AC51"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "2560x1440.png", "id": "1138414718159936", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499307311_1138414721493269_3022796374307437688_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Mj0QTPjIkikQ7kNvwHik2gS&_nc_oc=AdnLopg9AzXKsaDtEIOo6RB-WEln_xiugx6lBrQ2Hrq0AxMUc6AwsSJbiKTS7iHePsA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfxCaFhWCI22ylYFCv_WNFnuxEOpUuG_VXugFgkrm4dCNw&oe=69B2C4AA"}, "display_name": "Revisit: Time Travel with Google Earth", "keywords": ["GoogleEarth", "travel", "timetravel", "magic", "history"], "long_description": "**Miss New York\u2019s classic yellow cabs in Times Square?**  \n**Curious how the Eiffel Tower or Notre-Dame evolved through the decades?**\n\n**Revisit** lets you explore the past and present of **any real place**\u2014powered by Google Street View.  \nFrom famous landmarks to your old neighborhood, watch how places change over time in immersive 360\u00b0.\n\n\ud83c\udf00 **Drag the Time Rift** \u2014 a split between two timelines \u2014 to compare \u201cThen\u201d and \u201cNow.\u201d  \n\u2728 **Customize the Time Rift\u2019s visual style**: glow lines, glitch edges, vintage fades, and more.\n\n\ud83c\udf0d **Featured Destinations**\n- \ud83d\ude95 **Times Square** \u2013 From grit to glitz  \n- \ud83d\udfe3 **Las Vegas Sphere** \u2013 What came before  \n- \ud83d\udd32 **Shibuya Crossing** \u2013 Before the digital flood  \n- \ud83d\uddfc **Eiffel Tower** \u2013 Decades of change  \n- \u26ea **Notre-Dame** \u2013 From tragedy to rebirth\n\nYou're not limited to presets \u2014 **time travel anywhere** Street View goes.  \nYour own street. A dream trip. A place that no longer exists.\n\n\ud83d\udca1 **What Makes It Unique**\n- \ud83c\udf00 **Time Rift**: Swipe to reveal the past \u2014 and style it your way  \n- \ud83c\udf10 **Real-world locations**, not fiction or CGI  \n- \ud83e\udded **Curated scenes + open exploration**\n\nMore features coming soon.  \n**Try Time Travel VR \u2014 and tell us where you want to go next.**\n\nContact us via Discord: https://discord.gg/X5pZxBdcgn\n\n", "short_description": "Go anywhere, anywhen. Explore the past and present of any real place with Google Street View.\n\n"}]}, "developer_name": "Revisit", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://moonvrhome.com/Time-Travel/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url